# The order ticket's price box groups thousands as the number is typed, and the order is placed
# at the number typed. Places nothing: only the box, the estimate and the hint are read.
name the limit price box groups thousands as it is typed
show-buy Oil
click FinanceOverhaulOrderTab-Limit
type FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField 1500000
wait 0.3
expect-text-is FinanceOverhaulLimitPriceField 1,500,000
expect-text FinanceOverhaulLimitHint 1,500,000
cleanup:
close-dialog
